      "lineRange": [
        12,
        86
      ],
      "summary": "Broadcasts a message from each zone, aggregates sensor-level adjacency into zone-to-zone weights, computes network pressure in normalized or additive form, and updates cascade risk with neighbour context text for the agents.",
